{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113123017105-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113162022\"/><p>傷者被送往明愛醫院救治。</p><p>今晨(13日)10時44分，一輛小巴駛離石硤尾窩仔街近偉智街一小巴站時，懷疑撞倒一名正在旁邊推單車的姓黃(76歲)老翁。黃翁右腳受傷，其後清醒被送往明愛醫院治理。姓林(76歲)小巴司機通過酒精呼氣測試，因涉嫌「危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:45.385242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:57:03.743760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:05.010575+00:00","content_hash":"2cbc8c957eda3e10eba92ac160cb4b073548d580bd6b26a16b130eda4e50ae1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:45.385242+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}